  m_text: "Many thanks to the following people for the use of their assets:\n\nLow-Poly
    Nature:\n\tLow-Poly Nature Pack\n\tby JustCreate\n\t-- Attribution 4.0\n\nSelect
    Crop Models:\n\tFarming Crops Low Poly Models\n\tby CraftPix\n\t-- Attribution
    4.0\n\nSelect Crop Models\nand Farm Models:\n\tFarm Ranch Pack\n\tby Pandazole\n\t--
    Attribution 4.0\n\nUI Assets:\n\t2D Casual Game UI HD\n\tby Marya Belevich\n\t--
    Attribution 4.0\n\nAnd a massive thanks once again to Danial Jumagaliyev for
    their ever-useful Leaderboard Manager Framework\n(https://danqzq.itch.io/leaderboard-creator)\n\nAnd
    finally, thank you for playing!"
